0101: def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
0102:     """
0103:     Stretch a rectilinear foreground line drawing so its outside edges sit next to the control markers.
0104: 
0105:     Input structure
0106:     - The background is the dominant color.
0107:     - One foreground color forms a connected rectilinear line drawing made exactly from full horizontal and vertical bars.
0108:     - The other foreground color consists of isolated control pixels outside the drawing.
0109:     Rule
0110:     - Find the unique rectangle that contains the original line drawing and has every control pixel one cell outside one of its sides.
